# Play test of The Bell Stack (CIPlay bell_stack, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the landing beach at
# -12 -38 (0.6 m) and its ramp up the stack's west side to the top (5 m); the pilgrims' hut x -6..-3, z -29..-26, its
# doorway in the north wall at -3.75 -26; the rope bridge x 0 from z -16.5 (5 m) to z -7 (9 m); the chapel x -5.5..-2.5,
# z -4..0.5, open to the south; the bell tower at 0 2.5; the cell bridge x 0 from z 7 to 16 at 9 m (shown when the bell
# rings); the hermit's cell x -2.25..2.25, z 26..29, open to the south
island The Bell Stack
offset -0.7757 -2.2826
expect step 0
expect title The Torn Chant
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden cellbridge
wait 5

# The landing: the page on the mooring post
walk -12 -38.5 to -12 -37.5 h=0.6
zone landing
expect step 1
read Chant, first page
# Up the ramp onto the landing stack; the hut's page, the cairn's page
walk -12 -37 to -9 -33 to -6 -29.5 to -2 -27 h=5
walk -2 -24 to -3.75 -24.5 to -3.75 -27 h=5.1 below=7
read Chant, second page
read Chant, third page
# Over the rope bridge to the chapel stack; the bell is silent before the chant is whole
walk 0 -19 to 0 -12 to 0 -6 to 0 -4 h=9
zone chapelstack
use bell
expect message isn't whole
walk -4 -5.5 to -4 -2.5 h=9.1 below=11
read Chant, fourth page
read Chant, fifth page
read Chant, sixth page
expect step 2

# The bell rung: the bridge to the cell is there; across it to the hermit's chest
use bell
expect shown cellbridge
expect story rung 1
expect step 3
walk 0 5.5 to 0 10 to 0 16 to 0 24 h=9
zone cellstack
walk 0 24 to 0 27.5 h=9.1 below=11
open Hermit's chest
expect done
